  "preText": "",
  "text": "<b>gottim, snaffled at slip! Moeen Munir Ali!</b> What a moment. Head landed a couple of body blows but Moeen puts him flat on the canvas with a superb delivery that pitches on a length and rips away, jams the shoulder of the bat and loops to Root at slip. Started with a helping of filth and then the jaffa. <i>That</i> will make the pain of his spinning finger feel worth it",
  "postText": "In walks Cameron Green. Slip, leg slip and short leg. Edgbaston beginning to tick again",
  "shortText": "Ali to Head, OUT",
